          "text": "Crazy story actually... \n\nSo I was just walking through Greenguard forest the other day, minding my own business, when I heard a <b>TERRIBLE SOUND!</b> \n\nIt was as if the very heavens had been ripped open with an unholy and terrifying force, and so immediately I /unsheathed and turned around to face my fate.",
